\ ***************************************************************************
\ STARGLIDER for the BBC Master - what the step's logic draws on its frame
\
\ The ST draws the enemies' laser lines, the mines' messages and the
\ player's bolt as its logic runs, into the screen being drawn, before
\ frame_end shows it. The port draws them after the step's logic, onto the
\ frame that step drew, before it's shown (call 2, option B: in force
\ until Matt says otherwise).
\ ***************************************************************************

\ view_overlays: frame_show's (engine.6502), with draw_buffer and draw_bank
\ naming the screen drawn, from main RAM with the logic's bank and ANDY
\ paged. A layer to come.
.view_overlays
